  "title": "Remitly Evolves Hiring for AI Talent",
  "summary": "We are reimagining our job families for the AI era. Introducing the Knowledge Development Engineer (KDE) – a new role for AI-first builders who direct agents to design, build, and ship solutions, rather than writing code directly. We are now hiring KDEs in select offices and opening a student program this summer.",
